{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53924","headline":"题东林寺 一 · 周碏","name":"题东林寺 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"大中天子海恩深，再使迷徒识佛心。\n半死白莲初降[雨]（云）（从《殷礼在斯堂丛书》本改），欲成荒地又铺金。\n僧开石室经犹在，虎印溪泉迹未沉。\n谁谓五湖书剑客，此生重得见东林。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"周碏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53924.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53924","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}